AB  - Artificial Intelligence (AI) today is truly sophisticated, which of course brings many benefits to human activities, such as especially in the world of education. Examples of AI used in the world of education such as students are ChatGPT and DeepSeek. AI ChatGPT and DeepSeek can be said to be AI Large Language Models that use transformer architecture, so they can understand, process, and produce or respond to human language. In this study, we compare the quality of AI ChatGPT and DeepSeek, using the assessment variables System Quality, Information Quality, Service Quality, Intention to Use, and User Satisfaction. The method of data collection to compare the two AIs was by survey method on students who are currently carrying out educational activities, with a total of 383 respondents, and 365 of them are active students. The purpose of this study is to find out and find the quality of AI and to find out the feelings of use while using AI ChatGPT and DeepSeek. Of course, both AIs, such as ChatGPT and DeepSeek, have their respective advantages. For example, ChatGPT AI shows its strength in its ability to adapt to users and also has strong capabilities in interactivity, context awareness, and language understanding. While DeepSeek provides very high-quality analytical reasoning and the ability to execute tasks precisely, and also offers more consistent performance across all measured variables. This means that each of the advantages of ChatGPT and DeepSeek has a positive impact on students who are pursuing higher education.
